    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "gmnotes": "",
      "short": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<div>\n<p>While this spell lasts, nearly invisible tendrils of energy surround you. As part of casting this spell or as a move action once per round, you can direct the energy to do one of the following.</p><ul>\n<li>Attempt a dirty trick combat maneuver as a melee attack against an adjacent creature. When attempting this melee attack, you can use your key ability score modififier in place of your Strength modifier.</li>\n<li>Direct bothersome and distressing sensations against an adjacent creature. That creature must succeed at a Will save (DC = 12 + your key ability score modififier) or become @UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.conditions.Item.MZ8OoH1GE9qDMyCD]{Flat-Footed} until the beginning of your next turn.</li>\n<li>Grant you concealment until thr start of your next turn.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>"
    },
